#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:8
msgid ""
"Every employee's KPI is calculated once a month from the tasks in this "
"portal. The rules are the same for everyone and every number can be checked "
"on the employee's KPI page."
msgstr ""
"Har bir xodimning KPI koʻrsatkichi oyiga bir marta ushbu portaldagi "
"topshiriqlar asosida hisoblanadi. Qoidalar hamma uchun bir xil, har bir "
"raqamni xodimning KPI sahifasida tekshirish mumkin."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:10
msgid "Which tasks count"
msgstr "Qaysi topshiriqlar hisobga olinadi"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:12
msgid "A task belongs to the month in which its deadline falls."
msgstr "Topshiriq muddati tugaydigan oyga tegishli hisoblanadi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:13
msgid "Cancelled tasks are not counted."
msgstr "Bekor qilingan topshiriqlar hisobga olinmaydi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:14
msgid ""
"A task is assessed when it has been accepted by the manager, or when its "
"deadline has passed and it has not been handed in (then it counts as not "
"done)."
msgstr ""
"Topshiriq rahbar tomonidan qabul qilinganda yoki muddati oʻtib, "
"topshirilmagan boʻlsa baholanadi (bu holda bajarilmagan hisoblanadi)."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:15
msgid ""
"Tasks handed in and waiting for the manager's review are not counted until "
"they are reviewed, so a slow review never lowers the employee's score."
msgstr ""
"Topshirilgan va rahbar tekshiruvini kutayotgan topshiriqlar "
"tekshirilmaguncha hisobga olinmaydi — shu sababli tekshiruvning kechikishi "
"xodim bahosini pasaytirmaydi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:16
msgid ""
"Timeliness is judged by the date the executor handed the work in, not by the"
" date the manager accepted it."
msgstr ""
"Muddatga rioya rahbar qabul qilgan sana boʻyicha emas, ijrochi ishni "
"topshirgan sana boʻyicha baholanadi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:19
msgid "Task weight by complexity"
msgstr "Murakkablik boʻyicha topshiriq vazni"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:20
msgid "Harder tasks weigh more in every component:"
msgstr "Murakkabroq topshiriqlar barcha koʻrsatkichlarda koʻproq vaznga ega:"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:30
msgid "Four components (each from 0 to 100)"
msgstr "Toʻrt koʻrsatkich (har biri 0 dan 100 gacha)"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:32
msgid "points of completed tasks ÷ points of all assessed tasks."
msgstr ""
"bajarilgan topshiriqlar ballari ÷ barcha baholangan topshiriqlar ballari."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:33
msgid ""
"points of tasks handed in by the deadline ÷ points of all assessed tasks."
msgstr ""
"muddatida topshirilgan topshiriqlar ballari ÷ barcha baholangan topshiriqlar"
" ballari."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:34
msgid ""
"the manager's average rating (1–5) of completed tasks, weighted by points, "
"as a share of 5."
msgstr ""
"bajarilgan topshiriqlar boʻyicha rahbarning oʻrtacha bahosi (1–5), ballar "
"boʻyicha tortilgan, 5 ga nisbatan ulushi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:35
#, python-format
msgid ""
"points of completed tasks ÷ monthly norm (default %(norm)s points, can be "
"set per person), at most 100. During the current month the norm is reduced "
"in proportion to the days that have passed."
msgstr ""
"bajarilgan topshiriqlar ballari ÷ oylik meʼyor (standart %(norm)s ball, har "
"bir xodim uchun alohida belgilanishi mumkin), koʻpi bilan 100. Joriy oyda "
"meʼyor oʻtgan kunlarga mutanosib ravishda kamaytiriladi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:38
msgid "Final score"
msgstr "Yakuniy ball"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:39
msgid "manager adjustments"
msgstr "rahbar tuzatishlari"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:39
msgid "from 0 to 100"
msgstr "0 dan 100 gacha"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A manager may add a bonus or penalty of up to ±%(m)s points per entry with a"
" written reason, for work that is not in the portal or for discipline "
"issues. The reason is visible to the employee."
msgstr ""
"Rahbar portalda aks etmagan ishlar yoki intizom masalalari uchun sababini "
"yozgan holda har bir yozuvga ±%(m)s ballgacha ragʻbat yoki jarima qoʻllashi "
"mumkin. Sabab xodimga koʻrinadi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:41
msgid ""
"If a component cannot be measured (for example, nothing was completed, so "
"there is nothing to rate), its weight is shared among the other components."
msgstr ""
"Agar koʻrsatkichni oʻlchab boʻlmasa (masalan, hech narsa bajarilmagani uchun"
" baholanadigan ish yoʻq), uning vazni boshqa koʻrsatkichlar oʻrtasida "
"taqsimlanadi."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:43
msgid "Grades"
msgstr "Baholar"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:45 templates/kpi/methodology.html:46
#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:47
#, python-format
msgid "%(t)s and above"
msgstr "%(t)s va undan yuqori"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:48
#, python-format
msgid "below %(t)s"
msgstr "%(t)s dan past"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:51
msgid "Closing the month"
msgstr "Oyni yakunlash"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:52
msgid ""
"After the month ends the manager reviews the remaining tasks and finalises "
"the month. Finalised results are frozen: later edits to tasks or settings do"
" not change them. A finalised month can be reopened if a correction is "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Oy tugagach, rahbar qolgan topshiriqlarni koʻrib chiqadi va oyni yakunlaydi."
" Yakunlangan natijalar qayd etiladi: keyinchalik topshiriqlar yoki "
"sozlamalar oʻzgarsa ham ular oʻzgarmaydi. Tuzatish zarur boʻlsa, yakunlangan"
" oyni qayta ochish mumkin."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:54
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Misol"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:55
msgid ""
"An employee had 4 tasks due in the month: two medium (2 points each), one "
"complex (3) and one simple (1) — 8 points in total. The complex task was "
"handed in a day late, the simple one was not done. Ratings: 5, 4 and 4."
msgstr ""
"Xodimning oy davomida muddati tugaydigan 4 ta topshirigʻi bor edi: ikkita "
"oʻrtacha (har biri 2 ball), bitta murakkab (3) va bitta oddiy (1) — jami 8 "
"ball. Murakkab topshiriq bir kun kechikib topshirildi, oddiysi bajarilmadi. "
"Baholar: 5, 4 va 4."

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:57
msgid "Execution = 7 ÷ 8 = 87.5"
msgstr "Bajarilish = 7 ÷ 8 = 87,5"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:58
msgid "Timeliness = 4 ÷ 8 = 50"
msgstr "Muddatga rioya = 4 ÷ 8 = 50"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:59
msgid "Quality = (2×5 + 2×4 + 3×4) ÷ 7 = 4.29 of 5 = 85.7"
msgstr "Sifat = (2×5 + 2×4 + 3×4) ÷ 7 = 5 dan 4,29 = 85,7"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:60
msgid "Workload with a norm of 20 = 7 ÷ 20 = 35"
msgstr "Ish hajmi (meʼyor 20) = 7 ÷ 20 = 35"

#: templates/kpi/methodology.html:61
msgid ""
"KPI = 0.35×87.5 + 0.25×50 + 0.25×85.7 + 0.15×35 = 69.8 (Satisfactory) with "
"the default weights"
msgstr ""
"KPI = 0,35×87,5 + 0,25×50 + 0,25×85,7 + 0,15×35 = 69,8 (Qoniqarli) — "
"standart vaznlarda"

